{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1496996-golden-calibration-solar-charms-revised","id":1496996,"title":"Golden Calibration: Solar Charms Revised","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-11-13T11:11:15-08:00","id":1496996,"title":"Golden Calibration: Solar Charms Revised","content":"I've finally finished my rewrite of the Solar Charmset for Exalted Third Edition, <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/sh/h98mpo2f6xsed97/AADyaUz4TvX-I731isdk38XRa?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Golden Calibration</b></a>. This project (which took me over a year) completely revises the original set, including rewritten Charms that are easier to understand, mechanical fixes, and the use of powerful layout magic to include things like tables. It also includes a large number of all-new Charms and a full set of Charm cascades for each Ability.<br /> <br /> A general overview of the changes made:<ul><li>The balance of combat Abilities was largely left the same, although I think you'll find them all much easier to read and understand now.</li> <li>Awareness, Bureaucracy, Investigation, Larceny, Linguistics, Occult, Performance, Sail, and War all received heavy modifications in response to complaints.</li> <li>In general, I tried to address people's complaints about <i>how </i>a Charm worked, but not about whether it existed at all.</li> <li>I reworked how the Charm headers are set up so they'd take up less space. Between this and not including a space between paragraphs, incidentally, I was able to chop 50 pages off the Charms chapter (before I added the Charm cascades) even though there are <i>more </i>Charms.</li> </ul>I'd like to thank all the people who helped out with comments and testing, and also give a big shout-out to <a href=\"https://www.nathanielsantore.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Nathaniel Santore</a>, who did the amazing cover art.<br /> <br /> As o